Hi,

I have deployed shinyapp in shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>.  Later in my dev environment (using EC2), I updated certain R packages causing issues in the app in the dev environment. I am unable to restore the original versions of those packages as some of them were basically the devtool versions of the packages which would have undergone changes by now.  How can I use the downloaded app package from shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> and use those packages back in my dev environment.

