Daniel,
I am guessing this is the same issue we were seeing over the weekend where shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> isn't giving the correct error message.  Is it at all possible that you are running with R version 3.2.5?  If so, downgrading to 3.2.4 should fix this issue.  The error message should be saying something like: shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> doesn't support this version of R yet.

-Tareef

